Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Custom Fields|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Custom Fields Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	When CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Boolean|
		|customFieldType|True/False|
		|resourceName|Blogs Entry|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Date|
		|customFieldType|Date|
		|resourceName|Bookmarks Entry|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Decimal|
		|customFieldType|Decimal Number (64-bit)|
		|resourceName|Bookmarks Folder|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Decimal|
		|customFieldType|Group of Decimal Numbers (64-bit)|
		|resourceName|Document|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Decimal|
		|customFieldType|Decimal Number (32-bit)|
		|resourceName|Documents Folder|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Integer|
		|customFieldType|Integer (64-bit)|
		|resourceName|Message Boards Category|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Integer|
		|customFieldType|Group of Integers (64-bit)|
		|resourceName|Message Boards Message|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Number|
		|customFieldType|Decimal Number or Integer (64-bit)|
		|resourceName|Organization|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Integer|
		|customFieldType|Integer (16-bit)|
		|resourceName|Page|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Integer|
		|customFieldType|Group of Integers (16-bit)|
		|resourceName|Role|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Text|
		|customFieldType|Text|
		|resourceName|Site|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Text|
		|customFieldType|Group of Text Values|
		|resourceName|User|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Text|
		|customFieldType|Group of Text Values|
		|resourceName|User Group|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Text|
		|customFieldType|Localized Text|
		|resourceName|Web Content Article|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	Then CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Number|
		|customFieldType|Group of Decimal Numbers or Integers (64-bit)|
		|resourceName|Wiki Page|
Scenario: Add Custom Field User Boolean
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Boolean|
		|customFieldType|True/False|
		|resourceName|User|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User goto Edit CP
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	Then User view User Miscellaneous Custom Fields CP
		|customFieldName|Boolean|
		|customFieldValue|False|
Scenario: Edit Custom Field User Boolean
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Boolean|
		|customFieldType|True/False|
		|resourceName|User|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	And CustomFields edit CP
		|customFieldName|Boolean|
		|customFieldType|True/False|
		|defaultValue|True|
		|resourceName|User|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User goto Edit CP
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	Then User view User Miscellaneous Custom Fields CP
		|customFieldName|Boolean|
		|customFieldValue|True|
Scenario: Edit Revert Custom Field Wiki Page
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Custom Fields|
	When CustomFields add CP
		|customFieldName|Text|
		|customFieldType|Text|
		|resourceName|Wiki Page|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG
	And WikiPage add PG
		|customFieldText|Wiki Text Custom Field|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiPage edit Page PG
		|customFieldTextEdit|Wiki Text Custom Field Edit|
		|wikiPageContentEdit|Wiki Page Content Edit|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiPage view Page PG
		|customFieldText|Wiki Text Custom Field Edit|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content Edit|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiPage revert Edit PG
		|wikiPageRevisionNew|1.2|
		|wikiPageRevisionOld|1.0|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiVersionSummary|Reverted to 1.0|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	Then WikiPage view Page PG
		|customFieldText|Wiki Text Custom Field|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|